{{!--
  The chooser for a feature that is a menu (D-618, D-619): one select over
  the options the class's level has reached, each option's effect listed
  under it so the choice is made with the rule in view. An option's tag is a
  totem's level, a creature's tier and weight class, or "known" on a form
  already learned; the note, where there is one, is the Forms count.
  DialogV2 wraps this in its own <form>; the field name `choice` is the
  contract with workflows.mjs.

  WHERE THE USE TAKES MORE THAN ONE (02 SS7's Totem Mastery, D-710) the select
  becomes a checkbox on every row - the same list, the same greying - and the
  prompt says how many. It is the ONE chooser either way (D-673). A row may
  arrive `checked`, and `selectAll` puts a row above the list that ticks every
  one that is still open (D-721).

  `multi` and `max` are spread onto every option as well as the root: a bare
  name inside `#each` resolves against the row, not the root (D-609).
--}}
<div class="azeroth-dialog azeroth-choose">
  <div class="azeroth-dialog-row">
    {{#if multi}}
    <span class="azeroth-choose-prompt">{{prompt}}</span>
    {{else}}
    <label for="azeroth-choose-select">{{prompt}}</label>
    <select id="azeroth-choose-select" name="choice" autofocus>
      {{#each options as |o|}}
      <option value="{{o.index}}"{{#if o.disabled}} disabled{{/if}}{{#if o.selected}} selected{{/if}}>{{o.name}}{{#if o.tag}} ({{o.tag}}){{/if}}</option>
      {{/each}}
    </select>
    {{/if}}
  </div>
  {{#if note}}<p class="azeroth-dialog-note azeroth-choose-note">{{note}}</p>{{/if}}
  {{!-- Every row at once (D-721). A checklist's row only, above the list, and
        carrying NO data-action: DialogV2 has no actions map, and a checkbox
        emits change rather than click either way. --}}
  {{#if selectAll}}
  <label class="azeroth-choose-tick azeroth-choose-all">
    <input type="checkbox" name="all">
    <span>{{localize "AZEROTH.Feature.SelectAll"}}</span>
  </label>
  {{/if}}
  <dl class="azeroth-choose-list">
    {{#each options as |o|}}
    <div class="azeroth-choose-option{{#if o.disabled}} is-unavailable{{/if}}" data-index="{{o.index}}">
      <dt>
        {{#if o.multi}}
        <label class="azeroth-choose-tick">
          <input type="checkbox" name="choice" value="{{o.index}}"{{#if o.disabled}} disabled{{/if}}{{#if o.checked}} checked{{/if}}{{#if o.selected}} autofocus{{/if}}>
          <span>{{o.name}}</span>
        </label>
        {{else}}{{o.name}}{{/if}}
        {{#if o.tag}} <span class="azeroth-choose-level">{{o.tag}}</span>{{/if}}
      </dt>
      <dd>{{{o.html}}}</dd>
    </div>
    {{/each}}
  </dl>
</div>
